<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />

<title>Murden Cove Cinema</title>

<style>
:root {
  --max: 980px;
  --sidebar: 250px;
  --bg-top: #0f172a;
  --bg-bottom: #020617;
  --card-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.94);
  --text-main: #0f172a;
  --text-muted: #64748b;
  --accent: #f97316;
  --accent-soft: rgba(249,115,22,0.14);
  --accent-strong: #7c2d12;
  --shadow-soft: 0 22px 50px rgba(15,23,42,0.22);
  --radius-lg: 22px;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(249,115,22,0.28), transparent 35%),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--bg-top), #1e293b 45%, var(--bg-bottom));
  color: var(--text-main);
  min-height: 100vh;
}

.sidebar {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0 auto 0 0;
  width: var(--sidebar);
  height: 100%;
  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98);
  color: #f9fafb;
  overflow-y: auto;
  padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
  box-shadow: 2px 0 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, .35);
  z-index: 100;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1rem;
}

.sidebar-title {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}

.sidebar-badge {
  width: 9px;
  height: 9px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px var(--accent-soft);
}

.sidebar-subtitle {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: #cbd5f5;
}

.sidebar-nav {
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4);
  padding-top: 0.75rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.25rem;
}

.sidebar a {
  display: block;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  color: #e5e7eb;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 0.98rem;
  border-radius: 10px;
}

.sidebar a:hover {
  background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
}

.sidebar a.current {
  background: rgba(249,115,22,0.18);
  color: #fed7aa;
  border: 1px solid rgba(251,146,60,0.38);
}

.content { margin-left: var(--sidebar); }

header {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 2rem 1.25rem 1rem;
  color: #f8fafc;
}

header h1 {
  margin: 0 0 .25rem;
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
}

header p {
  margin: 0 auto;
  color: #cbd5e1;
  max-width: 760px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

main {
  max-width: var(--max);
  margin: auto;
  padding: 0 1.25rem 3rem;
}

.intro-card,
.movie-card {
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.intro-card {
  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.94);
  color: #f8fafc;
  border: 1px solid rgba(251,146,60,0.28);
  padding: 1.5rem;
  text-align: center;
}

.intro-pill,
.movie-pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(249,115,22,0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(251,146,60,0.35);
  color: #fed7aa;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
}

.intro-dot,
.movie-dot {
  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--accent);
}

.intro-card h2 {
  margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
  font-size: 1.45rem;
}

.intro-card p {
  margin: 0 auto;
  color: #cbd5e1;
  line-height: 1.5;
  max-width: 760px;
}

.movie-card {
  background: var(--card-bg);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
}

.movie-head {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(249,115,22,0.22), transparent 35%),
    linear-gradient(135deg, #111827, #431407);
  color: #f8fafc;
  padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
}

.movie-head h2 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 1.35rem;
}

.movie-meta {
  margin-top: 0.35rem;
  color: #fed7aa;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
}

.video-wrap {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  padding-top: 56.25%;
  background: #000;
}

.video-wrap iframe {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border: 0;
}

.movie-note {
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  line-height: 1.45;
}

@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .sidebar {
    position: static;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .content { margin-left: 0; }

  .sidebar-nav {
    flex-direction: row;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  header { padding-top: 1.25rem; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav class="sidebar">
  <div>
    <div class="sidebar-title">
      <span class="sidebar-badge"></span>
      Murden Cove
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-subtitle">Bainbridge Island • Washington</div>
  </div>

  <div class="sidebar-nav">
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="kayak.html">Paddle Log</a>
    <a href="cove-birds.html">Cove Birds</a>
    <a href="cove-critters.html">Cove Critters</a>
    <a href="frog-rock.html">Frog Rock</a>
    <a href="halloween-tales.html">Halloween Tales</a>
    <a href="favorite-movies.html" class="current">Murden Cove Cinema</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="content">

<header>
  <h1>Murden Cove Cinema</h1>
  <p>A small screening room for favorite documentaries, horror oddities, mysteries, and cult treasures.</p>
</header>

<main>

<section class="intro-card">
  <div class="intro-pill">
    <span class="intro-dot"></span>
    Private Screening Room
  </div>
  <h2>Things Worth Watching</h2>
  <p>
    A curated collection of favorite films and strange cinematic treasures — part documentary shelf,
    part late-night cable, part video-store staff-pick wall.
  </p>
</section>

<article class="movie-card">
  <div class="movie-head">
    <div class="movie-pill">
      <span class="movie-dot"></span>
      Documentary
    </div>
    <h2>The Rock-afire Explosion</h2>
    <div class="movie-meta">A documentary about nostalgia, animatronics, fandom, and preservation.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="video-wrap">
    <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/gTmhS6hcY-A" title="The Rock-afire Explosion" allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="movie-note">
    A strange and surprisingly touching documentary about the fans who preserved the animatronic
    Rock-afire Explosion band long after the pizza parlors disappeared. Equal parts nostalgia,
    Americana, and obsession.
  </div>
</article>

<article class="movie-card">
  <div class="movie-head">
    <div class="movie-pill">
      <span class="movie-dot"></span>
      Mystery Documentary
    </div>
    <h2>Resurrect Dead: The Mystery of the Toynbee Tiles (2011)</h2>
    <div class="movie-meta">A street-level mystery about messages embedded in asphalt.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="video-wrap">
    <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/M9k5hb0ETPw" title="Resurrect Dead: The Mystery of the Toynbee Tiles" allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="movie-note">
    One of the great modern mystery documentaries. An investigation into the bizarre Toynbee Tiles
    embedded in streets across North and South America becomes a meditation on obsession, outsider art,
    and the people who refuse to let mysteries die.
  </div>
</article>

<article class="movie-card">
  <div class="movie-head">
    <div class="movie-pill">
      <span class="movie-dot"></span>
      Horror
    </div>
    <h2>Pumpkinhead: Blood Feud</h2>
    <div class="movie-meta">Folk horror, vengeance, curses, and late-night cable energy.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="video-wrap">
    <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/RcgXAsOb3Uc" title="Pumpkinhead: Blood Feud" allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="movie-note">
    Appalachian revenge, ancient curses, and Pumpkinhead mythology. A moody late-series horror entry
    with the right kind of October atmosphere.
  </div>
</article>

<article class="movie-card">
  <div class="movie-head">
    <div class="movie-pill">
      <span class="movie-dot"></span>
      Cult Selection
    </div>
    <h2>Feature Presentation</h2>
    <div class="movie-meta">A favorite oddity from the Murden Cove screening room.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="video-wrap">
    <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/LYTK6QicICo" title="Feature Presentation" allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="movie-note">
    A strange little treasure whose place in the collection is secured simply by being memorable.
  </div>
</article>

<article class="movie-card">
  <div class="movie-head">
    <div class="movie-pill">
      <span class="movie-dot"></span>
      Documentary • Mystery • Sci-Fi
    </div>
    <h2>The Institute</h2>
    <div class="movie-meta">A documentary about art, mystery, conspiracy, and alternate reality.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="video-wrap">
    <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/sK7myhXVyNU" title="The Institute" allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="movie-note">
    A fascinating documentary about the Jejune Institute, an elaborate alternate-reality experience
    that blurred the lines between art, conspiracy, mystery, and personal transformation.
  </div>
</article>

</main>
</div>

</body>
</html>
